; Send again the parts another station asked for.
FORM PARTS_REPEAT
TITLE Send missing parts again
SUMMARY Sends one station the parts it asked for, now. For a flagged station, or one that cannot wait for the queue. Most asks go with the resend queue.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 86
ACTION parts_resend
FIELD id Request(@parts_requests) required
BEGIN_HELP
Request:
Each request names the station and the part numbers it lacks. Only parts already sent to that station go again, and only when its signature checks.
END
